cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ldmgen: a generator-neutral event record for light-dark-matter simulation"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
authors:
  - family-names: Mina
    given-names: Rob
    affiliation: "University of Virginia"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2241-8566"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RobMina/ldmgen"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  ldmgen defines a generator-neutral event record for light-dark-matter production and scattering (ldmgen/1, HDF5), with adapters for BdNMC and similar generators, comparison tools, a public interchange layer on HepMC3 with a thin LdmHepMC attribute profile, and HEPEVT sinks for experiment simulations.
keywords:
  - "light dark matter"
  - "event generator"
  - "HepMC3"
  - "HDF5"
  - "beam dump"
  - "particle physics"
